From fec9f46d4f0ad13038d3ab1c13a396cca993231b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:45:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Warm other dimensions' shader pack pipelines in the
 background

Builds the nether/end folders' pipelines on 2 threads after the running pack settles, drops
them; Metal's on-disk cache keeps the work. Warm skips the mc_Entity/block/item id tables
(unused by pipelines), keeping the main-thread hitch small.
